+## 3. Gate-consumption audit
+
+| item | hostile verdict | reason |
+|---|---|---|
+| `COST/BUD`, `LOC`, `IND` (RN:53-105) | **PASS** | They are direct sums of promoted Lemmas A/B and the local multiplicity identity; no attainment is used. |
