+```text
+b=1: [2]14, [2^(1)]5, [2^(2)]3, [2^(3)]2, [2^(4)]1,
+     [22]6, [22^(1)]2, [22^(2)]2,
+     [3]8, [3^(1)]3, [3^(2)]2, [3^(3)]1,
