+```text
+lambda_i * 1^(N-|lambda_i|),
+```
+
+not `lambda_i * 1^(a_i)` as RN:503-504 states.  As printed, some permutations do
+not even have degree `N`; this also explains why placements with different `a_i`
+cannot be encoded by that OPEN.
